          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Predictable plan and font-cache staging paths follow local symlinks\n\nThe Python and npm CLIs record edit plans through .<plan-name>.<pid>.partial using ordinary truncating writes. A different local user able to create entries in the plan directory can preplant that name as a symlink to another file writable by the victim; the write truncates and replaces the referent's contents before the rename. The native CLI uses exclusive private staging and does not share this failure. The native font-index writer has the same mechanism when a trusted operator configures its cache parent as a directory writable by another principal (JUBARTE_FONT_INDEX or shared user-font location). Its default per-user cache does not establish that prerequisite.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Symlink following in temporary file creation\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-61\n\nRemediation:\nRoute Python recording through the existing native exclusive publication function. For npm, exclusively create a randomly named private staging directory/file in the plan parent, write and verify through a held descriptor, then atomically rename. Refuse existing staging names and avoid following links. Apply exclusive private staging to FontIndex::save as well, and keep shared cache storage segregated by OS principal.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Integration probes preplant predicted legacy partial symlinks for both CLIs and assert unrelated files remain unchanged.\n- Test successful recording, dry-run, existing plan links and concurrent recording with exclusive staging.\n- For a deliberately shared configured font-index parent, preplant the legacy PID temporary link and assert unrelated files remain unchanged."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:0de5e305edc2a79f93320a100fea2c029bd7fed666d2de5d6f50b723ffd94975"
          },
          "properties": {
            "category": "Symlink following in temporary file creation",
            "confidence": "high",
            "findingId": "csf_8e4b0b14cb63a30d38fdbc99",
            "occurrenceId": "occ_043c0ed1afa2e3d5c9d895c4",
            "severity": "low"
          },
          "ruleId": "symlink-following.plan-staging",
          "ruleIndex": 54
        },
