          "message": {
            "text": "PDF font subsetting can enumerate billions of codepoints\n\nAn embedded TrueType font with a compact format12 or format13 cmap range ending at u32::MAX can make PDF conversion perform about 4.29 billion callbacks. The converter only keeps BMP entries, but filters them after the unbounded enumeration.\n Assigned discovery-0032 preserves Windows platform 3/encoding 10 format13 acceptance and the inclusive full-u32 group: 4294967296 callbacks. Tuple evaluation also performs glyph lookup when u16 conversion fails.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Excessive iteration Excessive iteration over attacker defined font ranges\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-834\n\nRemediation:\nGenerate the BMP subset by bounded codepoint lookup or explicitly intersect and budget ranges before enumeration. Bound cumulative iteration across subtables, including overlapping ranges.\nAdditional retained remediation detail: Enumerate the bounded output codepoint domain directly, or intersect encoded ranges with it before enumeration. Bound aggregate mappings/work across subtables and reject invalid or excessive ranges before callbacks.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Cover format12 and format13 ranges extending beyond Unicode and u16 bounds without enumerating them.\n- Verify many overlapping subtables also respect a cumulative work budget.\n- Subset a minimal format13 full-u32 range under a deterministic small work budget and assert bounded handling.\n- Cover format12, overlapping groups, non-BMP ranges and multiple subtables while preserving normal BMP mappings."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:5959686c4af8481316c8b20d67ecc8ce21f3cef50f1644c87ea95f06b805303a"
          },
          "properties": {
            "category": "Excessive iteration\nExcessive iteration over attacker-defined font ranges",
            "confidence": "high",
            "findingId": "csf_ee82536925c3faabcb055f4a",
            "occurrenceId": "occ_19cce2a260812284d17bd4d6",
            "severity": "medium"
          },
          "ruleId": "unbounded-iteration.pdf-font-cmap",
          "ruleIndex": 65
        },
