          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "UTF-16 XML can retain confidential text after successful scrub or redaction\n\nJubarte accepts UTF-16 XML but scrub and leak detection read it as lossy UTF-8. Metadata transforms silently skip it, and redaction postchecks can miss a remaining confidential copy in UTF-16 custom XML while returning successful output.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Improper handling of Unicode encoding\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-176\n\nRemediation:\nUse one encoding-aware XML decoder for admission, privacy transformations and leakage checks. Fail closed when an accepted XML part cannot be decoded or parsed for a privacy operation; scan all supported encodings consistently before certifying redaction.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Cover UTF-16LE and UTF-16BE metadata scrubbing at conventional and alternate locations.\n- Redact a visible UTF-8 occurrence while a second copy exists in UTF-16 custom XML and require REDACTION_LEAK for both clean/redline outputs."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:d67caaedba43d890ea7deb01f77e80fa68de21bfd6ba0c0225a67d84f7ab00a1"
          },
          "properties": {
            "category": "Improper handling of Unicode encoding",
            "confidence": "high",
            "findingId": "csf_6971fbd04aa6a684463b89f5",
            "occurrenceId": "occ_76ec853f4b04bae621837b83",
            "severity": "medium"
          },
          "ruleId": "encoding-mismatch.utf16-privacy-postconditions",
          "ruleIndex": 15
        },
        {
          "level": "warning",
          "locations": [
            {
              "message": {
                "text": "root_control"
              },
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/convert/altchunk.rs"
                },
