          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Shallow malformed XML can bypass admission and overflow the DOM parser stack\n\nMalformed unquoted attributes can make tolerant package admission observe shallow XML while the permissive DOM constructs deeply nested elements without a depth guard. Repeated sibling <p a=//> tags are one framing; a=x followed by b=\"x>...\" can expose attribute-contained <n> tags as another. Rendering is the earlier affected route; WmlDocument::from_bytes followed by lazy main_document is the newly supplied route. Strict checked inspection rejects the malformed attribute form. A further supplied shallow sibling framing, <a b=x></a>x>, makes the DOM swallow the closing tag as attribute text and treat following siblings as descendants.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Uncontrolled recursion caused by parser disagreement\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-674\n\nRemediation:\nMake tolerant attribute tokenization identical between admission and DOM construction or refuse unsupported unquoted values, and enforce a real construction-depth limit or use an iterative DOM parser.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Ensure repeated `<p a=//>` siblings are refused or parsed at the same shallow depth without recursion growth.\n- Compare admitted and constructed structure for malformed empty tags and unquoted attribute delimiters.\n- Admit and parse a package with the differential attribute shape and thousands of hidden start tags; assert bounded refusal without deep recursion.\n- Cover mixed quotes, unquoted values and start-tag boundaries against both scanners.\n- Use a small deterministic document with extreme semantic values or alternate valid OPC paths and assert controlled refusal or complete selected sanitization before expensive processing.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Enforce resource limits at the parser that consumes the representation, even when a preceding scanner also checks them."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:66357a151ff0ec905d4d9773de13683caea9ac4b239a6de5db676d2055bb855c"
          },
          "properties": {
