          "message": {
            "text": "Converting Markdown with an untrusted reference DOCX can exhaust the call stack\n\n`markdown_to_docx` opens and parses the reference DOCX without XML admission. A deeply nested ordinary `word/document.xml` reaches the recursive DOM parser before any later revision processing can refuse it.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Unchecked XML recursion\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-674\n\nRemediation:\nAdmit options.reference before any reference inspection or assembly, return a typed reference refusal on failure, and use checked parsing when extracting section properties. Add a regression that supplies a normally named over-depth main document as reference through the Rust API and bindings.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Pass an over-depth reference with conventional word/document.xml through Rust and binding APIs and expect a typed refusal before parsing.\n- Verify default template conversion remains unchanged."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
