          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "PDF generation can hang on a font with many retained tables\n\nAn embedded TrueType font with at least 32768 retained directory records reaches a u16 doubling loop while its PDF subset is written. Normal release arithmetic wraps the loop state to zero and never terminates; overflow-checked builds panic.\n Assigned discovery-0032 supplies duplicate allowlisted name records as an alternative to the established duplicate cvt-space framing, with roughly 512 KiB of directory records at the threshold; usable selected non-catalogue glyf faces and used text remain required.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Integer overflow Integer overflow in loop termination arithmetic\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-190\n\nRemediation:\nReject duplicate sfnt tags and unreasonable table counts, calculate search metadata in a wider checked integer type, and refuse unrepresentable header values before looping.\nAdditional retained remediation detail: Reject duplicate font table tags and cap retained table count to the distinct supported set. Compute sfnt search metadata with checked wider arithmetic and return a controlled error for invalid counts.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Verify >=32768 retained records refuse without panic or nontermination in debug and release.\n- Cover searchRange/rangeShift overflow for lower counts as well.\n- Exercise duplicate table records at and below the 32768 threshold with bounded deterministic writer checks.\n- Assert duplicate-tag refusal before subsetting, and preserve normal font output in checked and release builds."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:a94fb05a96e306ff109524e7a1916eada0c0a8ee46f486c56447c9750ac68b3f"
          },
          "properties": {
            "category": "Integer overflow\nInteger overflow in loop termination arithmetic",
            "confidence": "high",
            "findingId": "csf_06aad04a55110c49864e83c0",
            "occurrenceId": "occ_e334f9c9ca68358092b10d60",
            "severity": "medium"
          },
          "ruleId": "integer-overflow.sfnt-table-search",
          "ruleIndex": 23
        },
