              "help": {
                "markdown": "Admission: Audit tracked permission preparse. Categories: XML admission bypass uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\n## Remediation\n\nAdmit both original and edited packages before check_dropped_permissions, or replace its raw parse_part with checked parsing under active limits.",
                "text": "Admission: Audit tracked permission preparse. Categories: XML admission bypass uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\nRemediation:\n\nAdmit both original and edited packages before check_dropped_permissions, or replace its raw parse_part with checked parsing under active limits."
              },
              "id": "admission.audit-tracked-permission-preparse",
              "name": "Admission: Audit tracked permission preparse",
