            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Admission: Auxiliary XML extension. Categories: XML admission bypass uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Admission: Auxiliary XML extension. Categories: XML admission bypass uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\n## Remediation\n\nValidate every actual XML part under active InputLimits immediately before DOM construction, or use content types/relationships to include all consumed XML in admission. Cover headers, footers, notes, comments and styles regardless filename.",
                "text": "Admission: Auxiliary XML extension. Categories: XML admission bypass uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\nRemediation:\n\nValidate every actual XML part under active InputLimits immediately before DOM construction, or use content types/relationships to include all consumed XML in admission. Cover headers, footers, notes, comments and styles regardless filename."
              },
              "id": "admission.auxiliary-xml-extension",
              "name": "Admission: Auxiliary XML extension",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "XML admission bypass / uncontrolled recursion",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-674",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Admission: Auxiliary XML extension"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Admission: Markdown reference unchecked XML. Categories: XML admission bypass uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Admission: Markdown reference unchecked XML. Categories: XML admission bypass uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\n## Remediation\n\nAdmit the reference before any consumed part reaches the permissive parser, or use checked parsing with explicit limits for every consumed reference XML part.",
                "text": "Admission: Markdown reference unchecked XML. Categories: XML admission bypass uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\nRemediation:\n\nAdmit the reference before any consumed part reaches the permissive parser, or use checked parsing with explicit limits for every consumed reference XML part."
              },
              "id": "admission.markdown-reference-unchecked-xml",
              "name": "Admission: Markdown reference unchecked XML",
