            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Algorithmic complexity: Font index rewrites. Categories: Algorithmic Complexity. Weaknesses: CWE-407."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Algorithmic complexity: Font index rewrites. Categories: Algorithmic Complexity. Weaknesses: CWE-407.\n\n## Remediation\n\nBatch font-index persistence once per conversion, bound/evict recorded unknown names and total index size, limit family-resolution work, and avoid rescanning/reformatting the entire index for each miss.",
                "text": "Algorithmic complexity: Font index rewrites. Categories: Algorithmic Complexity. Weaknesses: CWE-407.\n\nRemediation:\n\nBatch font-index persistence once per conversion, bound/evict recorded unknown names and total index size, limit family-resolution work, and avoid rescanning/reformatting the entire index for each miss."
              },
