            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Algorithmic complexity: Legacy doc field stack. Categories: Algorithmic complexity in nested field processing. Weaknesses: CWE-400, CWE-407."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Algorithmic complexity: Legacy doc field stack. Categories: Algorithmic complexity in nested field processing. Weaknesses: CWE-400, CWE-407.\n\n## Remediation\n\nMaintain an O(1) active-code-frame count, updating it correctly on begin, separator and end while preserving suppression under any code ancestor. Enforce explicit field-nesting and processing-work budgets for balanced and malformed legacy field streams before excessive work.\n\nMaintain an O(1) active-code-frame count, updating it correctly on begin, separator and end while preserving suppression under any code ancestor. Enforce explicit field-nesting and processing-work budgets for balanced and malformed legacy field streams before excessive work. Keep legacy diagnostic probes cheap and bounded, or enforce the same field/work budgets before invoking the full reader solely for a refusal hint.",
                "text": "Algorithmic complexity: Legacy doc field stack. Categories: Algorithmic complexity in nested field processing. Weaknesses: CWE-400, CWE-407.\n\nRemediation:\n\nMaintain an O(1) active-code-frame count, updating it correctly on begin, separator and end while preserving suppression under any code ancestor. Enforce explicit field-nesting and processing-work budgets for balanced and malformed legacy field streams before excessive work.\n\nMaintain an O(1) active-code-frame count, updating it correctly on begin, separator and end while preserving suppression under any code ancestor. Enforce explicit field-nesting and processing-work budgets for balanced and malformed legacy field streams before excessive work. Keep legacy diagnostic probes cheap and bounded, or enforce the same field/work budgets before invoking the full reader solely for a refusal hint."
              },
              "id": "algorithmic-complexity.legacy-doc-field-stack",
              "name": "Algorithmic complexity: Legacy doc field stack",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "Algorithmic complexity in nested field processing",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-400",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-407",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Algorithmic complexity: Legacy doc field stack"
              }
