                "text": "Algorithmic complexity: Legacy placeholder. Categories: Quadratic internal placeholder selection. Weaknesses: CWE-407.\n\nRemediation:\n\nSkip placeholder selection when no empty paragraph requires it. Otherwise scan text once for occupied candidate suffixes or construct a delimiter using a bounded number of linear passes."
