              "help": {
                "markdown": "Algorithmic complexity: Markdown revision split. Categories: Algorithmic complexity. Weaknesses: CWE-407.\n\n## Remediation\n\nCompute all split boundaries in one pass and build the final run vector once, moving/slicing source content rather than repeatedly cloning it. Apply an explicit revision-ID/work budget before conversion.",
                "text": "Algorithmic complexity: Markdown revision split. Categories: Algorithmic complexity. Weaknesses: CWE-407.\n\nRemediation:\n\nCompute all split boundaries in one pass and build the final run vector once, moving/slicing source content rather than repeatedly cloning it. Apply an explicit revision-ID/work budget before conversion."
