            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Algorithmic complexity: Revision origin correspondence. Categories: Inefficient algorithmic complexity. Weaknesses: CWE-407."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Algorithmic complexity: Revision origin correspondence. Categories: Inefficient algorithmic complexity. Weaknesses: CWE-407.\n\n## Remediation\n\nBuild merged-member counts and singleton source indexes in one pass over fates, keyed by settled paragraph, then inspect only singleton merged groups. Review neighboring repeated scans and enforce an explicit correspondence-work budget.",
                "text": "Algorithmic complexity: Revision origin correspondence. Categories: Inefficient algorithmic complexity. Weaknesses: CWE-407.\n\nRemediation:\n\nBuild merged-member counts and singleton source indexes in one pass over fates, keyed by settled paragraph, then inspect only singleton merged groups. Review neighboring repeated scans and enforce an explicit correspondence-work budget."
              },
