              "help": {
                "markdown": "Comment anchor output resource exhaustion. Categories: Allocation without resource limits. Weaknesses: CWE-770.\n\n## Remediation\n\nEnforce a cumulative comment-anchor/output byte budget before cloning, return a typed refusal or bounded/truncated representation, and consider shared ranges or streaming records instead of duplicating every full anchor in memory.",
                "text": "Comment anchor output resource exhaustion. Categories: Allocation without resource limits. Weaknesses: CWE-770.\n\nRemediation:\n\nEnforce a cumulative comment-anchor/output byte budget before cloning, return a typed refusal or bounded/truncated representation, and consider shared ranges or streaming records instead of duplicating every full anchor in memory."
