              "help": {
                "markdown": "Credential exposure: Publish token argv. Categories: Sensitive credentials in process arguments. Weaknesses: CWE-214.\n\n## Remediation\n\nRemove the --token argument and let uv obtain the already exported UV_PUBLISH_TOKEN through its environment-variable credential mechanism. Keep credential values out of process arguments and release logs.",
                "text": "Credential exposure: Publish token argv. Categories: Sensitive credentials in process arguments. Weaknesses: CWE-214.\n\nRemediation:\n\nRemove the --token argument and let uv obtain the already exported UV_PUBLISH_TOKEN through its environment-variable credential mechanism. Keep credential values out of process arguments and release logs."
