                "text": "Encoding mismatch: Utf16 privacy postconditions. Categories: Improper handling of Unicode encoding. Weaknesses: CWE-176.\n\nRemediation:\n\nUse one encoding-aware XML decoder for admission, privacy transformations and leakage checks. Fail closed when an accepted XML part cannot be decoded or parsed for a privacy operation; scan all supported encodings consistently before certifying redaction."
