              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Filesystem: Cli output symlink race. Categories: Check then write symlink race. Weaknesses: CWE-367."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Filesystem: Cli output symlink race. Categories: Check then write symlink race. Weaknesses: CWE-367.\n\n## Remediation\n\nUse exclusive no-clobber creation for absent outputs and private staging with atomic rename when replacement is authorized. Hold the destination parent and avoid reopening a checked final path with symlink-following truncation.",
                "text": "Filesystem: Cli output symlink race. Categories: Check then write symlink race. Weaknesses: CWE-367.\n\nRemediation:\n\nUse exclusive no-clobber creation for absent outputs and private staging with atomic rename when replacement is authorized. Hold the destination parent and avoid reopening a checked final path with symlink-following truncation."
              },
