            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Filesystem: Font index predictable staging. Categories: Insecure temporary file creation symlink following. Weaknesses: CWE-61."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Filesystem: Font index predictable staging. Categories: Insecure temporary file creation symlink following. Weaknesses: CWE-61.\n\n## Remediation\n\nCreate unpredictable private staging or exclusive temporary files through a held parent handle; retain the created handle, verify bytes and atomically rename that file into place. Never open a preexisting staging pathname for truncation.",
                "text": "Filesystem: Font index predictable staging. Categories: Insecure temporary file creation symlink following. Weaknesses: CWE-61.\n\nRemediation:\n\nCreate unpredictable private staging or exclusive temporary files through a held parent handle; retain the created handle, verify bytes and atomically rename that file into place. Never open a preexisting staging pathname for truncation."
