                "text": "Incomplete sanitization: Relocated opc privacy parts. Categories: Incomplete removal of sensitive information. Weaknesses: CWE-212.\n\nRemediation:\n\nDiscover all applicable metadata, people, comments, settings and story parts through relationships and content types. Apply the requested transforms to every discovered part and assert privacy-specific postconditions before returning success."
