                "text": "Infinite loop: Page border float. Categories: Nonprogressing floating point rendering loop. Weaknesses: CWE-835."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Infinite loop: Page border float. Categories: Nonprogressing floating point rendering loop. Weaknesses: CWE-835.\n\n## Remediation\n\nValidate finite, reasonable page/margin/border geometry before layout. Use a bounded integer segment count instead of open-ended float accumulation, enforce a maximum border-operation budget, and explicitly refuse any step that cannot advance.",
                "text": "Infinite loop: Page border float. Categories: Nonprogressing floating point rendering loop. Weaknesses: CWE-835.\n\nRemediation:\n\nValidate finite, reasonable page/margin/border geometry before layout. Use a bounded integer segment count instead of open-ended float accumulation, enforce a maximum border-operation budget, and explicitly refuse any step that cannot advance."
