            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Insecure temporary file: Plan recording. Categories: Insecure temporary file. Weaknesses: CWE-377."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Insecure temporary file: Plan recording. Categories: Insecure temporary file. Weaknesses: CWE-377.\n\n## Remediation\n\nUse exclusive unpredictable staging in the destination directory, retain the opened handle for writing, and rename only that owned regular file. Reuse the native publication implementation for Python where possible; use exclusive creation (wx) with equivalent symlink/race protection in Node.",
                "text": "Insecure temporary file: Plan recording. Categories: Insecure temporary file. Weaknesses: CWE-377.\n\nRemediation:\n\nUse exclusive unpredictable staging in the destination directory, retain the opened handle for writing, and rename only that owned regular file. Reuse the native publication implementation for Python where possible; use exclusive creation (wx) with equivalent symlink/race protection in Node."
              },
