              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Integer overflow: Sfnt table search. Categories: Integer overflow Integer overflow in loop termination arithmetic. Weaknesses: CWE-190."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Integer overflow: Sfnt table search. Categories: Integer overflow Integer overflow in loop termination arithmetic. Weaknesses: CWE-190.\n\n## Remediation\n\nReject duplicate sfnt tags and unreasonable table counts, calculate search metadata in a wider checked integer type, and refuse unrepresentable header values before looping.\nAdditional retained remediation detail: Reject duplicate font table tags and cap retained table count to the distinct supported set. Compute sfnt search metadata with checked wider arithmetic and return a controlled error for invalid counts.",
                "text": "Integer overflow: Sfnt table search. Categories: Integer overflow Integer overflow in loop termination arithmetic. Weaknesses: CWE-190.\n\nRemediation:\n\nReject duplicate sfnt tags and unreasonable table counts, calculate search metadata in a wider checked integer type, and refuse unrepresentable header values before looping.\nAdditional retained remediation detail: Reject duplicate font table tags and cap retained table count to the distinct supported set. Compute sfnt search metadata with checked wider arithmetic and return a controlled error for invalid counts."
              },
              "id": "integer-overflow.sfnt-table-search",
              "name": "Integer overflow: Sfnt table search",
              "properties": {
