              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Legacy doc markdown prefix complexity. Categories: Algorithmic complexity denial of service. Weaknesses: CWE-407.\n\n## Remediation\n\nTrack a running all-ASCII-digits prefix flag while iterating once, or identify the sole initial numeric-list delimiter once. Preserve escaping behavior with linear work.",
                "text": "Legacy doc markdown prefix complexity. Categories: Algorithmic complexity denial of service. Weaknesses: CWE-407.\n\nRemediation:\n\nTrack a running all-ASCII-digits prefix flag while iterating once, or identify the sole initial numeric-list delimiter once. Preserve escaping behavior with linear work."
