            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Legacy doc sparse table expansion. Categories: Allocation without resource limits. Weaknesses: CWE-409, CWE-770."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Legacy doc sparse table expansion. Categories: Allocation without resource limits. Weaknesses: CWE-409, CWE-770.\n\n## Remediation\n\nBefore rectangularizing a table, use checked multiplication to enforce a generated-cell quota and enforce cumulative output-byte/work limits. Refuse over-budget tables with a typed error. Enforce a supported column ceiling and cover doc_to_markdown and doc_to_docx's Markdown intermediate; a bounded sparse representation is another option.",
                "text": "Legacy doc sparse table expansion. Categories: Allocation without resource limits. Weaknesses: CWE-409, CWE-770.\n\nRemediation:\n\nBefore rectangularizing a table, use checked multiplication to enforce a generated-cell quota and enforce cumulative output-byte/work limits. Refuse over-budget tables with a typed error. Enforce a supported column ceiling and cover doc_to_markdown and doc_to_docx's Markdown intermediate; a bounded sparse representation is another option."
              },
              "id": "legacy-doc-sparse-table-expansion",
              "name": "Legacy doc sparse table expansion",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "Allocation without resource limits",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-409",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-770",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Legacy doc sparse table expansion"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Legacy edit anchor search complexity. Categories: Algorithmic complexity denial of service. Weaknesses: CWE-407."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Legacy edit anchor search complexity. Categories: Algorithmic complexity denial of service. Weaknesses: CWE-407.\n\n## Remediation\n\nUse a linear-time substring matcher for exact and normalized legacy anchors, reusing the v2 KMP approach, while preserving overlapping-hit semantics and source-offset mapping. Add explicit cumulative matching-work limits where needed.",
                "text": "Legacy edit anchor search complexity. Categories: Algorithmic complexity denial of service. Weaknesses: CWE-407.\n\nRemediation:\n\nUse a linear-time substring matcher for exact and normalized legacy anchors, reusing the v2 KMP approach, while preserving overlapping-hit semantics and source-offset mapping. Add explicit cumulative matching-work limits where needed."
              },
              "id": "legacy-edit-anchor-search-complexity",
              "name": "Legacy edit anchor search complexity",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "2.0",
                "tags": [
                  "Algorithmic complexity denial of service",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-407",
