                "text": "Metadata scrubbing: Utf16 XML"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Nested field instruction amplification. Categories: Unbounded allocation and work from semantic field nesting. Weaknesses: CWE-770."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Nested field instruction amplification. Categories: Unbounded allocation and work from semantic field nesting. Weaknesses: CWE-770.\n\n## Remediation\n\nBound semantic field depth and total instruction/hash work before copying. Use shared instruction representations and incremental/compositional field hashes instead of materializing every full nested code chain; return a typed refusal when budgets are exceeded.",
                "text": "Nested field instruction amplification. Categories: Unbounded allocation and work from semantic field nesting. Weaknesses: CWE-770.\n\nRemediation:\n\nBound semantic field depth and total instruction/hash work before copying. Use shared instruction representations and incremental/compositional field hashes instead of materializing every full nested code chain; return a typed refusal when budgets are exceeded."
              },
