              "help": {
                "markdown": "Post expansion XML depth bypass. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\n## Remediation\n\nBound HTML nesting/generated output and validate expanded WML under active depth/tag limits before DOM construction.",
                "text": "Post expansion XML depth bypass. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\nRemediation:\n\nBound HTML nesting/generated output and validate expanded WML under active depth/tag limits before DOM construction."
