            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Predictable plan staging symlink. Categories: Improper link resolution in temporary file publication, Improper link resolution in temporary file publication Insecure temporary file creation, Insecure temporary file creation. Weaknesses: CWE-377, CWE-59, CWE-61."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Predictable plan staging symlink. Categories: Improper link resolution in temporary file publication, Improper link resolution in temporary file publication Insecure temporary file creation, Insecure temporary file creation. Weaknesses: CWE-377, CWE-59, CWE-61.\n\n## Remediation\n\nUse exclusive unpredictable private staging and hold directory/file handles until atomic publication. Reuse native publication for Python and implement equivalent exclusive/no-follow staging for Node; never reopen an attacker-controlled temporary pathname.\n\nUse exclusive, unpredictable staging owned by a private directory, hold the opened handle through writing, and rename that verified file. Reuse the native publication design or equivalent mkstemp/exclusive wx APIs and never follow existing staging entries. Python can reuse native publication; Node needs equivalent secure publication semantics.\n\nUse exclusive, unpredictable staging owned by a private directory, hold the opened handle through writing, and rename that verified file. Reuse the native publication design or equivalent mkstemp/exclusive wx APIs and never follow existing staging entries. Python can reuse native publication; Node needs equivalent secure publication semantics. Preserve intentional final-plan symlink resolution to its authorized resolved target while securing the separate staging object; successful recording installs a verified regular plan file and failure preserves prior output.\nAdditional retained remediation detail: Use an exclusively created private staging directory/file held by handle, verify staged bytes, and atomically publish to the authorized plan target. Refuse preexisting staging objects and preserve intended final-plan symlink semantics without following a staging symlink.",
                "text": "Predictable plan staging symlink. Categories: Improper link resolution in temporary file publication, Improper link resolution in temporary file publication Insecure temporary file creation, Insecure temporary file creation. Weaknesses: CWE-377, CWE-59, CWE-61.\n\nRemediation:\n\nUse exclusive unpredictable private staging and hold directory/file handles until atomic publication. Reuse native publication for Python and implement equivalent exclusive/no-follow staging for Node; never reopen an attacker-controlled temporary pathname.\n\nUse exclusive, unpredictable staging owned by a private directory, hold the opened handle through writing, and rename that verified file. Reuse the native publication design or equivalent mkstemp/exclusive wx APIs and never follow existing staging entries. Python can reuse native publication; Node needs equivalent secure publication semantics.\n\nUse exclusive, unpredictable staging owned by a private directory, hold the opened handle through writing, and rename that verified file. Reuse the native publication design or equivalent mkstemp/exclusive wx APIs and never follow existing staging entries. Python can reuse native publication; Node needs equivalent secure publication semantics. Preserve intentional final-plan symlink resolution to its authorized resolved target while securing the separate staging object; successful recording installs a verified regular plan file and failure preserves prior output.\nAdditional retained remediation detail: Use an exclusively created private staging directory/file held by handle, verify staged bytes, and atomically publish to the authorized plan target. Refuse preexisting staging objects and preserve intended final-plan symlink semantics without following a staging symlink."
              },
              "id": "predictable-plan-staging-symlink",
              "name": "Predictable plan staging symlink",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "2.0",
                "tags": [
                  "Improper link resolution in temporary-file publication",
                  "Improper link resolution in temporary-file publication\nInsecure temporary-file creation",
                  "Insecure temporary file creation",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-059",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-061",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-377",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Predictable plan staging symlink"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Quadratic paragraph suffix scan. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-407."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Quadratic paragraph suffix scan. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-407.\n\n## Remediation\n\nCompute suffix widths in a single reverse pass with resets at tab boundaries, or skip suffix work for tab-free segments.",
                "text": "Quadratic paragraph suffix scan. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-407.\n\nRemediation:\n\nCompute suffix widths in a single reverse pass with resets at tab boundaries, or skip suffix work for tab-free segments."
              },
