            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Redaction drawingml run fragments. Categories: Incomplete removal of sensitive information during redaction. Weaknesses: CWE-212."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Redaction drawingml run fragments. Categories: Incomplete removal of sensitive information during redaction. Weaknesses: CWE-212.\n\n## Remediation\n\nExtend leak detection to logical text of supported components, including DrawingML paragraphs/chart rich text, aligning with extraction logic. Add a body-redaction regression with matching split chart-title text and require refusal for both output packages. Include preserved diagram paragraphs as well as chart-title rich text, and fail closed when a supported text-bearing structure cannot be inspected.",
                "text": "Redaction drawingml run fragments. Categories: Incomplete removal of sensitive information during redaction. Weaknesses: CWE-212.\n\nRemediation:\n\nExtend leak detection to logical text of supported components, including DrawingML paragraphs/chart rich text, aligning with extraction logic. Add a body-redaction regression with matching split chart-title text and require refusal for both output packages. Include preserved diagram paragraphs as well as chart-title rich text, and fail closed when a supported text-bearing structure cannot be inspected."
              },
              "id": "redaction-drawingml-run-fragments",
              "name": "Redaction drawingml run fragments",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
