              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Redaction report context disclosure. Categories: Sensitive information exposure. Weaknesses: CWE-200."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Redaction report context disclosure. Categories: Sensitive information exposure. Weaknesses: CWE-200.\n\n## Remediation\n\nApply redaction-aware sanitization to every report, refusal and diagnostic field after resolving the full plan, including other operations' contexts. Check the final serialized reports for all redaction needles before publication, omitting unsafe context when needed.",
                "text": "Redaction report context disclosure. Categories: Sensitive information exposure. Weaknesses: CWE-200.\n\nRemediation:\n\nApply redaction-aware sanitization to every report, refusal and diagnostic field after resolving the full plan, including other operations' contexts. Check the final serialized reports for all redaction needles before publication, omitting unsafe context when needed."
              },
