            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Redaction verification: Namespace blind attributes. Categories: Overbroad sensitive data scan exemption. Weaknesses: CWE-200, CWE-201."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Redaction verification: Namespace blind attributes. Categories: Overbroad sensitive data scan exemption. Weaknesses: CWE-200, CWE-201.\n\n## Remediation\n\nRemove numeric exemptions from strict redaction verification, or restrict them to verified OOXML namespace/element/attribute combinations representing exclusively generated layout state. Always scan arbitrary custom XML business attributes.",
                "text": "Redaction verification: Namespace blind attributes. Categories: Overbroad sensitive data scan exemption. Weaknesses: CWE-200, CWE-201.\n\nRemediation:\n\nRemove numeric exemptions from strict redaction verification, or restrict them to verified OOXML namespace/element/attribute combinations representing exclusively generated layout state. Always scan arbitrary custom XML business attributes."
              },
