              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Document table span. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-789."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Resource exhaustion: Document table span. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\n## Remediation\n\nEnforce practical per-cell span/row-skip and checked cumulative table/grid/output budgets across direct OOXML gridSpan/gridBefore/gridAfter and HTML/MHT colspan. Apply the common limit before HTML generation and before RawCell, column/preference/merge allocation or span-sized work; use checked sums and col+span arithmetic and return a typed conversion refusal. Neither importer-only nor later layout-only checking is sufficient. Use fallible allocation/reservation within those bounds so capacity failures become typed refusals. Carry the caller-configurable column/occupancy budget through every table source and enforce a generated-XML/output ceiling before altChunk materialization.",
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Document table span. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\nRemediation:\n\nEnforce practical per-cell span/row-skip and checked cumulative table/grid/output budgets across direct OOXML gridSpan/gridBefore/gridAfter and HTML/MHT colspan. Apply the common limit before HTML generation and before RawCell, column/preference/merge allocation or span-sized work; use checked sums and col+span arithmetic and return a typed conversion refusal. Neither importer-only nor later layout-only checking is sufficient. Use fallible allocation/reservation within those bounds so capacity failures become typed refusals. Carry the caller-configurable column/occupancy budget through every table source and enforce a generated-XML/output ceiling before altChunk materialization."
              },
              "id": "resource-exhaustion.document-table-span",
              "name": "Resource exhaustion: Document table span",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "Uncontrolled resource consumption",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-789",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Document table span"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Docx table columns. Categories: Unbounded input driven allocation. Weaknesses: CWE-789."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Resource exhaustion: Docx table columns. Categories: Unbounded input driven allocation. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\n## Remediation\n\nValidate table spans and grid skips against a documented column/work budget before addition or allocation. Use checked arithmetic, bounded aggregate occupancy, and fallible allocation with a structured refusal.",
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Docx table columns. Categories: Unbounded input driven allocation. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\nRemediation:\n\nValidate table spans and grid skips against a documented column/work budget before addition or allocation. Use checked arithmetic, bounded aggregate occupancy, and fallible allocation with a structured refusal."
              },
              "id": "resource-exhaustion.docx-table-columns",
              "name": "Resource exhaustion: Docx table columns",
              "properties": {
