            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: HTML table columns. Categories: Unbounded generated output. Weaknesses: CWE-789."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Resource exhaustion: HTML table columns. Categories: Unbounded generated output. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\n## Remediation\n\nBound HTML colspan and aggregate table columns with checked arithmetic, and enforce generated-WML byte/work limits while expanding altChunks. Refuse oversized content with a structured resource error.",
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: HTML table columns. Categories: Unbounded generated output. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\nRemediation:\n\nBound HTML colspan and aggregate table columns with checked arithmetic, and enforce generated-WML byte/work limits while expanding altChunks. Refuse oversized content with a structured resource error."
              },
              "id": "resource-exhaustion.html-table-columns",
              "name": "Resource exhaustion: HTML table columns",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "Unbounded generated output",
