                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: HTML table columns"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Markdown namespace copy. Categories: Namespace memory amplification. Weaknesses: CWE-770."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Resource exhaustion: Markdown namespace copy. Categories: Namespace memory amplification. Weaknesses: CWE-770.\n\n## Remediation\n\nUse scope overlays or persistent maps storing shared URI values, and account retained namespace storage before allocation. Avoid cloning inherited String maps for every child declaration.",
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Markdown namespace copy. Categories: Namespace memory amplification. Weaknesses: CWE-770.\n\nRemediation:\n\nUse scope overlays or persistent maps storing shared URI values, and account retained namespace storage before allocation. Avoid cloning inherited String maps for every child declaration."
              },
