            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Markdown table range. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-789."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Resource exhaustion: Markdown table range. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\n## Remediation\n\nValidate row_paragraphs with the same bounded range helper used elsewhere, impose a total table/output cell budget before allocation, and return a structured refusal rather than silently processing an oversized range.",
                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Markdown table range. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\nRemediation:\n\nValidate row_paragraphs with the same bounded range helper used elsewhere, impose a total table/output cell budget before allocation, and return a structured refusal rather than silently processing an oversized range."
              },
