              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded allocation: Wml table grid. Categories: Resource exhaustion. Weaknesses: CWE-789."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Unbounded allocation: Wml table grid. Categories: Resource exhaustion. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\n## Remediation\n\nValidate gridSpan and row gridBefore/gridAfter counts against a bounded aggregate table-column budget before any arithmetic, iteration or allocation. Use checked addition and fallible allocations with typed conversion errors.",
                "text": "Unbounded allocation: Wml table grid. Categories: Resource exhaustion. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\nRemediation:\n\nValidate gridSpan and row gridBefore/gridAfter counts against a bounded aggregate table-column budget before any arithmetic, iteration or allocation. Use checked addition and fallible allocations with typed conversion errors."
              },
