              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded altchunk colspan expansion. Categories: Unchecked input controlling resource consuming loops. Weaknesses: CWE-606."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Unbounded altchunk colspan expansion. Categories: Unchecked input controlling resource consuming loops. Weaknesses: CWE-606.\n\n## Remediation\n\nBound colspan and the total table column count before iteration, use checked arithmetic, and enforce a cumulative generated-WML/output budget across each HTML chunk and document. Return a typed input-limit refusal before allocating oversized output.",
                "text": "Unbounded altchunk colspan expansion. Categories: Unchecked input controlling resource consuming loops. Weaknesses: CWE-606.\n\nRemediation:\n\nBound colspan and the total table column count before iteration, use checked arithmetic, and enforce a cumulative generated-WML/output budget across each HTML chunk and document. Return a typed input-limit refusal before allocating oversized output."
              },
