              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded decompression: Strict format probe. Categories: Unbounded decompression. Weaknesses: CWE-400, CWE-409."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Unbounded decompression: Strict format probe. Categories: Unbounded decompression. Weaknesses: CWE-400, CWE-409.\n\n## Remediation\n\nApply bounded admission before indexing/inflation and explicit cumulative inflated-byte/preamble/work limits to this public helper. Use a streaming lexical probe with bounded retained state for comments, declarations and chunk-spanning root tags; refuse excessive probes with a checked/limited API and safe default limits.",
                "text": "Unbounded decompression: Strict format probe. Categories: Unbounded decompression. Weaknesses: CWE-400, CWE-409.\n\nRemediation:\n\nApply bounded admission before indexing/inflation and explicit cumulative inflated-byte/preamble/work limits to this public helper. Use a streaming lexical probe with bounded retained state for comments, declarations and chunk-spanning root tags; refuse excessive probes with a checked/limited API and safe default limits."
              },
              "id": "unbounded-decompression.strict-format-probe",
              "name": "Unbounded decompression: Strict format probe",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
