                  "external/cwe/cwe-409",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded decompression: Strict format probe"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded expansion: Altchunk colspan. Categories: Uncontrolled resource allocation Unbounded allocation from HTML numeric input Unbounded generated markup expansion, Uncontrolled resource allocation Unbounded allocation from HTML numeric input Unbounded generated markup expansion Unbounded allocation through HTML table expansion. Weaknesses: CWE-400, CWE-770, CWE-789, CWE-834."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Unbounded expansion: Altchunk colspan. Categories: Uncontrolled resource allocation Unbounded allocation from HTML numeric input Unbounded generated markup expansion, Uncontrolled resource allocation Unbounded allocation from HTML numeric input Unbounded generated markup expansion Unbounded allocation through HTML table expansion. Weaknesses: CWE-400, CWE-770, CWE-789, CWE-834.\n\n## Remediation\n\nEnforce a practical maximum cell span and checked per-row/aggregate column counts before generating any table XML. Charge all HTML/MHT-generated WML, including repeated/nested tables, to a cumulative byte/work budget inside altChunk expansion and return a typed input-limit refusal before allocation or DOM construction.\n\nEnforce a practical maximum cell span and checked per-row/aggregate column counts before generating any table XML. Charge all HTML/MHT-generated WML, including repeated/nested tables, to a cumulative byte/work budget inside altChunk expansion and return a typed input-limit refusal before allocation or DOM construction.\nAdditional retained remediation detail: Bound individual spans and aggregate columns before summation or iteration, use checked arithmetic, and impose a cumulative generated-WML byte/element budget shared across every HTML/MHT altChunk. Refuse excessive expansion with a typed input-limit error before allocation.",
                "text": "Unbounded expansion: Altchunk colspan. Categories: Uncontrolled resource allocation Unbounded allocation from HTML numeric input Unbounded generated markup expansion, Uncontrolled resource allocation Unbounded allocation from HTML numeric input Unbounded generated markup expansion Unbounded allocation through HTML table expansion. Weaknesses: CWE-400, CWE-770, CWE-789, CWE-834.\n\nRemediation:\n\nEnforce a practical maximum cell span and checked per-row/aggregate column counts before generating any table XML. Charge all HTML/MHT-generated WML, including repeated/nested tables, to a cumulative byte/work budget inside altChunk expansion and return a typed input-limit refusal before allocation or DOM construction.\n\nEnforce a practical maximum cell span and checked per-row/aggregate column counts before generating any table XML. Charge all HTML/MHT-generated WML, including repeated/nested tables, to a cumulative byte/work budget inside altChunk expansion and return a typed input-limit refusal before allocation or DOM construction.\nAdditional retained remediation detail: Bound individual spans and aggregate columns before summation or iteration, use checked arithmetic, and impose a cumulative generated-WML byte/element budget shared across every HTML/MHT altChunk. Refuse excessive expansion with a typed input-limit error before allocation."
              },
              "id": "unbounded-expansion.altchunk-colspan",
              "name": "Unbounded expansion: Altchunk colspan",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "Uncontrolled resource allocation\nUnbounded allocation from HTML numeric input\nUnbounded generated markup expansion",
                  "Uncontrolled resource allocation\nUnbounded allocation from HTML numeric input\nUnbounded generated markup expansion\nUnbounded allocation through HTML table expansion",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-400",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-770",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-789",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-834",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded expansion: Altchunk colspan"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded expansion: HTML table colspan. Categories: Resource exhaustion. Weaknesses: CWE-400."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Unbounded expansion: HTML table colspan. Categories: Resource exhaustion. Weaknesses: CWE-400.\n\n## Remediation\n\nReject excessive per-cell and aggregate HTML column spans using checked arithmetic before output generation, and charge all altChunk-generated XML against an explicit expansion budget.",
                "text": "Unbounded expansion: HTML table colspan. Categories: Resource exhaustion. Weaknesses: CWE-400.\n\nRemediation:\n\nReject excessive per-cell and aggregate HTML column spans using checked arithmetic before output generation, and charge all altChunk-generated XML against an explicit expansion budget."
              },
              "id": "unbounded-expansion.html-table-colspan",
              "name": "Unbounded expansion: HTML table colspan",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "external/cwe/cwe-400",
