                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded expansion: HTML table colspan"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded expansion: Math glyph assembly. Categories: Uncontrolled memory allocation. Weaknesses: CWE-789."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Unbounded expansion: Math glyph assembly. Categories: Uncontrolled memory allocation. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\n## Remediation\n\nValidate MATH scale percentages and metrics against supported finite ranges; reject extreme geometry and enforce a cumulative assembly-glyph budget before converting ratios to counts or allocating. Enforce hard per-assembly repetition caps as well as aggregate glyph bounds before floating-point-to-usize casts, and cover both unmarked radicals and delimiters with small positive extender advance above overlap.",
                "text": "Unbounded expansion: Math glyph assembly. Categories: Uncontrolled memory allocation. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\nRemediation:\n\nValidate MATH scale percentages and metrics against supported finite ranges; reject extreme geometry and enforce a cumulative assembly-glyph budget before converting ratios to counts or allocating. Enforce hard per-assembly repetition caps as well as aggregate glyph bounds before floating-point-to-usize casts, and cover both unmarked radicals and delimiters with small positive extender advance above overlap."
              },
              "id": "unbounded-expansion.math-glyph-assembly",
              "name": "Unbounded expansion: Math glyph assembly",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "2.0",
                "tags": [
                  "Uncontrolled memory allocation",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-789",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded expansion: Math glyph assembly"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded iteration: Pdf font cmap. Categories: Excessive iteration Excessive iteration over attacker defined font ranges. Weaknesses: CWE-834."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Unbounded iteration: Pdf font cmap. Categories: Excessive iteration Excessive iteration over attacker defined font ranges. Weaknesses: CWE-834.\n\n## Remediation\n\nGenerate the BMP subset by bounded codepoint lookup or explicitly intersect and budget ranges before enumeration. Bound cumulative iteration across subtables, including overlapping ranges.\nAdditional retained remediation detail: Enumerate the bounded output codepoint domain directly, or intersect encoded ranges with it before enumeration. Bound aggregate mappings/work across subtables and reject invalid or excessive ranges before callbacks.",
                "text": "Unbounded iteration: Pdf font cmap. Categories: Excessive iteration Excessive iteration over attacker defined font ranges. Weaknesses: CWE-834.\n\nRemediation:\n\nGenerate the BMP subset by bounded codepoint lookup or explicitly intersect and budget ranges before enumeration. Bound cumulative iteration across subtables, including overlapping ranges.\nAdditional retained remediation detail: Enumerate the bounded output codepoint domain directly, or intersect encoded ranges with it before enumeration. Bound aggregate mappings/work across subtables and reject invalid or excessive ranges before callbacks."
              },
              "id": "unbounded-iteration.pdf-font-cmap",
              "name": "Unbounded iteration: Pdf font cmap",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "Excessive iteration\nExcessive iteration over attacker-defined font ranges",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-834",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded iteration: Pdf font cmap"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded number label expansion. Categories: Uncontrolled memory allocation. Weaknesses: CWE-789."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Unbounded number label expansion. Categories: Uncontrolled memory allocation. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\n## Remediation\n\nEnforce a finite expanded-marker byte budget before allocation for every numeric-format consumer. Refuse or safely fall back when start/counter values exceed format-specific limits; propagate a typed refusal instead of allocating. Cover list starts, startOverride, and endnote numbering.",
                "text": "Unbounded number label expansion. Categories: Uncontrolled memory allocation. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\nRemediation:\n\nEnforce a finite expanded-marker byte budget before allocation for every numeric-format consumer. Refuse or safely fall back when start/counter values exceed format-specific limits; propagate a typed refusal instead of allocating. Cover list starts, startOverride, and endnote numbering."
              },
              "id": "unbounded-number-label-expansion",
              "name": "Unbounded number label expansion",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "Uncontrolled memory allocation",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-789",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded number label expansion"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded numbering level iteration. Categories: Unchecked input controlling resource consuming loops. Weaknesses: CWE-606."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Unbounded numbering level iteration. Categories: Unchecked input controlling resource consuming loops. Weaknesses: CWE-606.\n\n## Remediation\n\nValidate paragraph, style, abstract-level and override ilvl values against the supported numbering-level range before storing or using them. Iterate only bounded known levels for lookup, counters and placeholders; reject unsupported values with a typed error.",
                "text": "Unbounded numbering level iteration. Categories: Unchecked input controlling resource consuming loops. Weaknesses: CWE-606.\n\nRemediation:\n\nValidate paragraph, style, abstract-level and override ilvl values against the supported numbering-level range before storing or using them. Iterate only bounded known levels for lookup, counters and placeholders; reject unsupported values with a typed error."
              },
              "id": "unbounded-numbering-level-iteration",
              "name": "Unbounded numbering level iteration",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "Unchecked input controlling resource-consuming loops",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-606",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded numbering level iteration"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded table alignment matrix. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-789."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Unbounded table alignment matrix. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\n## Remediation\n\nCheck row products against a comparison work/memory budget before all nested scans/allocations and use bounded-memory alignment or a typed refusal for excessive work.",
                "text": "Unbounded table alignment matrix. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-789.\n\nRemediation:\n\nCheck row products against a comparison work/memory budget before all nested scans/allocations and use bounded-memory alignment or a typed refusal for excessive work."
              },
