                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unbounded table alignment matrix"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Unchecked privacy XML recursion. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-674."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Unchecked privacy XML recursion. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\n## Remediation\n\nValidate each XML part with active depth/tag limits before DOM construction, reporting policy failure as a leak-scan refusal, or use a bounded streaming scan. Preserve deliberate empty-needle behavior; for nonempty needles, XML policy or encoding failures must produce a fail-closed incomplete-scan diagnostic even when the searched text is absent. Prefer the existing checked XML parser and preserve the failing part's context.",
                "text": "Unchecked privacy XML recursion. Categories: Uncontrolled resource consumption. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\nRemediation:\n\nValidate each XML part with active depth/tag limits before DOM construction, reporting policy failure as a leak-scan refusal, or use a bounded streaming scan. Preserve deliberate empty-needle behavior; for nonempty needles, XML policy or encoding failures must produce a fail-closed incomplete-scan diagnostic even when the searched text is absent. Prefer the existing checked XML parser and preserve the failing part's context."
              },
              "id": "unchecked-privacy-xml-recursion",
              "name": "Unchecked privacy XML recursion",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
