                  "external/cwe/cwe-674",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unchecked privacy XML recursion"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Drawing dependencies. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Uncontrolled recursion: Drawing dependencies. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\n## Remediation\n\nValidate drawing dependency graphs before materialization. Reject cycles and excessive traversal depth/work, and memoize materialized indexes so shared dependencies are not repeatedly expanded.",
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Drawing dependencies. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\nRemediation:\n\nValidate drawing dependency graphs before materialization. Reject cycles and excessive traversal depth/work, and memoize materialized indexes so shared dependencies are not repeatedly expanded."
              },
