                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Drawing dependencies"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Latex script ast. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Uncontrolled recursion: Latex script ast. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\n## Remediation\n\nBound actual AST depth and work when wrapping previous script/prime bases, and use iterative writing and safe nonrecursive destruction so rejection cannot itself drop an attacker-deep tree recursively.",
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Latex script ast. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\nRemediation:\n\nBound actual AST depth and work when wrapping previous script/prime bases, and use iterative writing and safe nonrecursive destruction so rejection cannot itself drop an attacker-deep tree recursively."
              },
