                  "external/cwe/cwe-674",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Latex script ast"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Markdown drawing dependencies. Categories: Uncontrolled dependency graph recursion Uncontrolled recursive dependency expansion. Weaknesses: CWE-674."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Uncontrolled recursion: Markdown drawing dependencies. Categories: Uncontrolled dependency graph recursion Uncontrolled recursive dependency expansion. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\n## Remediation\n\nValidate dependency indices, count/byte/depth limits and graph shape at import. Materialize with an active/completed traversal state and index-to-output map, rejecting cycles or reserving identities to support cycles without recursive expansion. Memoize shared subgraphs. Enforce explicit dependency-edge and traversal-work budgets before assembly; when rejecting active-node revisits return a typed conversion refusal. Apply the same graph validation and traversal state to header/footer drawing materialization, not only body drawings.",
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Markdown drawing dependencies. Categories: Uncontrolled dependency graph recursion Uncontrolled recursive dependency expansion. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\nRemediation:\n\nValidate dependency indices, count/byte/depth limits and graph shape at import. Materialize with an active/completed traversal state and index-to-output map, rejecting cycles or reserving identities to support cycles without recursive expansion. Memoize shared subgraphs. Enforce explicit dependency-edge and traversal-work budgets before assembly; when rejecting active-node revisits return a typed conversion refusal. Apply the same graph validation and traversal state to header/footer drawing materialization, not only body drawings."
              },
              "id": "uncontrolled-recursion.markdown-drawing-dependencies",
              "name": "Uncontrolled recursion: Markdown drawing dependencies",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "Uncontrolled dependency graph recursion\nUncontrolled recursive dependency expansion",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-674",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Markdown drawing dependencies"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Markdown story fields. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Uncontrolled recursion: Markdown story fields. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\n## Remediation\n\nEnforce a field-result nesting and generated-XML budget before materialization, returning a typed conversion refusal. Prefer an explicit stack and avoid rescanning nested suffixes at every level.",
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Markdown story fields. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\nRemediation:\n\nEnforce a field-result nesting and generated-XML budget before materialization, returning a typed conversion refusal. Prefer an explicit stack and avoid rescanning nested suffixes at every level."
              },
              "id": "uncontrolled-recursion.markdown-story-fields",
              "name": "Uncontrolled recursion: Markdown story fields",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
