                  "external/cwe/cwe-674",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Markdown story fields"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Unchecked auxiliary XML. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion through an admission bypass XML resource policy bypass. Weaknesses: CWE-20, CWE-674."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Uncontrolled recursion: Unchecked auxiliary XML. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion through an admission bypass XML resource policy bypass. Weaknesses: CWE-20, CWE-674.\n\n## Remediation\n\nApply active InputLimits at a centralized checked XML access/parse boundary for every semantic XML consumer regardless of filename, or resolve/classify and admit XML through actual content-type/relationship use. Cover theme, styles, numbering, converter comments/commentsExtended, notes and headers/footers; explicitly cover the now supplied validated settings_dom/settings_dom_xml cache-miss consumer, with earlier settings-only recommendations retained as historical source limitations. Preserve renamed-main checks, and enforce actual DOM construction depth or use iterative construction. Apply that same mandatory checked boundary to get_revisions and comparison notes parsing, including both footnotes and endnotes; propagate typed refusal under the active comparer InputLimits. Include pre_process_markup's relationship-selected notes at src/document_comparer.rs:4725-4750 and exposed Python get_revisions_json/WASM getRevisions; valid arbitrary part names remain supported. Include linked-textbox and diagram relationship targets in the mandatory filename-independent checked XML boundary before parse_xdocument and in regression coverage. These are now supplied validated affected consumers from discovery-0028; earlier sources' proposed-only status remains historical. Cover revision_processor RevisionIds collection and process_part for all six selected auxiliary buckets (headers, footers, endnotes, footnotes, comments and styles), including public revision acceptance/rejection. Explicitly include the now-confirmed fontTable loader (src/convert/font_table.rs:66-78; src/convert/mod.rs:806) in the mandatory checked XML boundary; parsing must be bounded before any font root/entry inspection. Explicitly cover comparison defined_style_ids (src/document_comparer.rs:4684-4696), relationship-selected footnotes/endnotes (4724-4750) and chart preprocessing (4861-4878), all reached through admitted nonidentical comparison inputs (6555-6569,6607-6625). Apply the same mandatory XML boundary before edit initialization's existing_comment_ids scan, not only in the later checked CommentFamily loader; preserve the effective checks at inspect::parse_part_within and edit::load_stories. Enforce the same checked boundary before settings DOM cache population, and preserve valid bounded nonstandard auxiliary filenames.",
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Unchecked auxiliary XML. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion through an admission bypass XML resource policy bypass. Weaknesses: CWE-20, CWE-674.\n\nRemediation:\n\nApply active InputLimits at a centralized checked XML access/parse boundary for every semantic XML consumer regardless of filename, or resolve/classify and admit XML through actual content-type/relationship use. Cover theme, styles, numbering, converter comments/commentsExtended, notes and headers/footers; explicitly cover the now supplied validated settings_dom/settings_dom_xml cache-miss consumer, with earlier settings-only recommendations retained as historical source limitations. Preserve renamed-main checks, and enforce actual DOM construction depth or use iterative construction. Apply that same mandatory checked boundary to get_revisions and comparison notes parsing, including both footnotes and endnotes; propagate typed refusal under the active comparer InputLimits. Include pre_process_markup's relationship-selected notes at src/document_comparer.rs:4725-4750 and exposed Python get_revisions_json/WASM getRevisions; valid arbitrary part names remain supported. Include linked-textbox and diagram relationship targets in the mandatory filename-independent checked XML boundary before parse_xdocument and in regression coverage. These are now supplied validated affected consumers from discovery-0028; earlier sources' proposed-only status remains historical. Cover revision_processor RevisionIds collection and process_part for all six selected auxiliary buckets (headers, footers, endnotes, footnotes, comments and styles), including public revision acceptance/rejection. Explicitly include the now-confirmed fontTable loader (src/convert/font_table.rs:66-78; src/convert/mod.rs:806) in the mandatory checked XML boundary; parsing must be bounded before any font root/entry inspection. Explicitly cover comparison defined_style_ids (src/document_comparer.rs:4684-4696), relationship-selected footnotes/endnotes (4724-4750) and chart preprocessing (4861-4878), all reached through admitted nonidentical comparison inputs (6555-6569,6607-6625). Apply the same mandatory XML boundary before edit initialization's existing_comment_ids scan, not only in the later checked CommentFamily loader; preserve the effective checks at inspect::parse_part_within and edit::load_stories. Enforce the same checked boundary before settings DOM cache population, and preserve valid bounded nonstandard auxiliary filenames."
              },
              "id": "uncontrolled-recursion.unchecked-auxiliary-xml",
              "name": "Uncontrolled recursion: Unchecked auxiliary XML",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
                  "Uncontrolled recursion through an admission bypass\nXML resource-policy bypass",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-020",
                  "external/cwe/cwe-674",
                  "security"
                ]
              },
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: Unchecked auxiliary XML"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: XML parser differential. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion caused by parser disagreement. Weaknesses: CWE-674."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Uncontrolled recursion: XML parser differential. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion caused by parser disagreement. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\n## Remediation\n\nMake tolerant attribute tokenization identical between admission and DOM construction or refuse unsupported unquoted values, and enforce a real construction-depth limit or use an iterative DOM parser.",
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion: XML parser differential. Categories: Uncontrolled recursion caused by parser disagreement. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\nRemediation:\n\nMake tolerant attribute tokenization identical between admission and DOM construction or refuse unsupported unquoted values, and enforce a real construction-depth limit or use an iterative DOM parser."
              },
