            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Unintended network access: Markdown unc. Categories: Unintended remote filesystem access before resource authorization. Weaknesses: CWE-918."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Unintended network access: Markdown unc. Categories: Unintended remote filesystem access before resource authorization. Weaknesses: CWE-918.\n\n## Remediation\n\nReject decoded absolute, prefixed, UNC and root-relative destinations before any ambient filesystem operation, and resolve accepted relative resources through the held directory capability. Apply the same policy to diagnostic-only paths.",
                "text": "Unintended network access: Markdown unc. Categories: Unintended remote filesystem access before resource authorization. Weaknesses: CWE-918.\n\nRemediation:\n\nReject decoded absolute, prefixed, UNC and root-relative destinations before any ambient filesystem operation, and resolve accepted relative resources through the held directory capability. Apply the same policy to diagnostic-only paths."
              },
