              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "XML policy bypass: Auxiliary part extension. Categories: XML resource policy bypass. Weaknesses: CWE-674."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "XML policy bypass: Auxiliary part extension. Categories: XML resource policy bypass. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\n## Remediation\n\nValidate every selected XML part immediately before DOM construction with active InputLimits, or classify all XML parts using content types and relationships in admission. Apply the same policy to auxiliary styles, themes, numbering and other XML consumers regardless of filename.",
                "text": "XML policy bypass: Auxiliary part extension. Categories: XML resource policy bypass. Weaknesses: CWE-674.\n\nRemediation:\n\nValidate every selected XML part immediately before DOM construction with active InputLimits, or classify all XML parts using content types and relationships in admission. Apply the same policy to auxiliary styles, themes, numbering and other XML consumers regardless of filename."
              },
              "id": "xml-policy-bypass.auxiliary-part-extension",
