            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "XML policy: Admission dom parser differential. Categories: Parser interpretation conflict XML depth bypass. Weaknesses: CWE-436, CWE-674."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "XML policy: Admission dom parser differential. Categories: Parser interpretation conflict XML depth bypass. Weaknesses: CWE-436, CWE-674.\n\n## Remediation\n\nMake admission and DOM construction consume the same grammar, reject unsupported DTDs at package admission, parse unquoted values correctly or refuse them, and enforce a hard depth budget inside DOM construction.",
                "text": "XML policy: Admission dom parser differential. Categories: Parser interpretation conflict XML depth bypass. Weaknesses: CWE-436, CWE-674.\n\nRemediation:\n\nMake admission and DOM construction consume the same grammar, reject unsupported DTDs at package admission, parse unquoted values correctly or refuse them, and enforce a hard depth budget inside DOM construction."
              },
              "id": "xml-policy.admission-dom-parser-differential",
              "name": "XML policy: Admission dom parser differential",
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "tags": [
