                "text": "Zip diagnostic amplification. Categories: Resource amplification during archive refusal. Weaknesses: CWE-400."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "Zip diagnostic amplification. Categories: Resource amplification during archive refusal. Weaknesses: CWE-400.\n\n## Remediation\n\nShort-circuit structural validation for production readers; separately bound individual diagnostic names and aggregate debug diagnostic bytes, and avoid copying shared malformed header data repeatedly.",
                "text": "Zip diagnostic amplification. Categories: Resource amplification during archive refusal. Weaknesses: CWE-400.\n\nRemediation:\n\nShort-circuit structural validation for production readers; separately bound individual diagnostic names and aggregate debug diagnostic bytes, and avoid copying shared malformed header data repeatedly."
